{"id": "EUVD-2026-81955", "enisaUuid": "cdf8e46e-70d7-36cd-af02-429e71052a94", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\narm64: process: Fix context switching MTE store-only tag check\n\nSCTLR_EL1.TCSO0 is set when user opt-in for MTE store-only tag check\nmode. However, it is not part of SCTLR_USER_MASK which imply that on\ncontext switch we never clear SCTLR_EL1.TCSO0, so we are leaking that\nsetting into another task.\n\nFix that by including SCTLR_EL1_TCSO0_MASK into SCTLR_USER_MASK", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:06:07", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:57:52", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/00a73ce437e27fdc636a5ede445a4a491e01788d", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2f10bc3ff24c91657887901c3235b803e5055f2b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b8f070ac3167595069feb1f794c127b805115645"], "aliases": ["GHSA-pj37-pf47-gwj8", "CVE-2026-90094"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "286e00d7-f279-33a2-8aa0-674ad1d800ec", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "4323b4d0-95f4-3c1b-9da2-c36e81c6af53", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "5c16350f-101b-32ad-8fe5-45f31e33a12d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "4d51ff5bba00a13ca9b0b24883fa7adb07a167fc <2f10bc3ff24c91657887901c3235b803e5055f2b"}, {"id": "6dc95209-a419-3b05-9724-4140d4a344f4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "4d51ff5bba00a13ca9b0b24883fa7adb07a167fc <b8f070ac3167595069feb1f794c127b805115645"}, {"id": "879c7ce4-e866-32fd-966a-55ddfe60866f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "4d51ff5bba00a13ca9b0b24883fa7adb07a167fc <00a73ce437e27fdc636a5ede445a4a491e01788d"}, {"id": "cbae2588-e2c7-3a0e-bcdd-63c4d808f2eb", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.52"}, {"id": "cc84def6-d5e8-3d4d-8dcf-bd870c348c82", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.17"}, {"id": "f0c43bcd-a396-302f-942f-d59257c2846e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.6"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b6e2452c-781c-34b6-9899-33483b4af881", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}